{"id":1390,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>5月23日，国防科技大学空天科学学院高超声速冲压发动机技术重点室在11号楼11110教室成功举办冲压推进技术硕博招生专场宣讲会。本次宣讲主要面向航空宇航科学与技术、能源动力工程等相关专业的本科生入学硕士研究生与硕士入学博士研究生。</p><p>宣讲会上，赵国焱副研究员围绕冲压推进技术领域在空天动力方面的科研平台优势、前沿研究方向、硕博士培养模式及招生政策等内容进行了系统介绍。与会同学认真聆听，并在交流环节就研究方向选择、科研能力准备、导师对接方式等问题与老师们进行了深入互动。</p><p>此次宣讲会不仅为同学们提供了与导师团队直接对接的宝贵机会，也进一步增强了大家投身国家空天动力事业的信心与热情。未来，高超声速冲压发动机技术重点室将继续欢迎有志于空天动力研究的优秀学子加入。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=jMm7w8L4UaLR6RnX7-YnR7snRLaLl7/4nR6Vnl7ZMzM2MmG0gihFp2hmCIa0USyDMShVMYysUm67U4lbL4-snlLDUlUiL8CZUm67M77ioz6FM4CsnmNin7QFLmrfMR9Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUsg47aMmUsgtA8pUKcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1047&nid=10647&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/A65E77B7DC59327EC6AD53F8B7D4A597/767F95DF/25A48\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 700px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=jMm7w8L4UaLR6RnX7-YnR7snRLaLl7/4nR6Vnl7ZMzM2MmG0gihFp2hmCIa0USyDMShVMYysUm67U4lbL4-snlLDUlUiL8CZUm67M77ioz6FM4CsnmNin7QFLmrfMR9Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUsg47aMmUsgtA8pUKcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1047&nid=10647&e=.jpg\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=jMN-wPMR7iUlCinX7WkMzfRozL8LRN/8MzQRL77ZMRGYUl70gihFp2hmCIa0n1yZnSh2USysoRrkLRNYMllZoR6fLm78oRGanlQkM87iLmWFnRW2Mm7ZUlVFLmMVUm7Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUsg47aMmUsgtA8pUKcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1047&nid=10647&e=.jpg\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/F8EFA785B0925E887A214800EFB7A522/D2F618AA/23EB1\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 700px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=jMN-wPMR7iUlCinX7WkMzfRozL8LRN/8MzQRL77ZMRGYUl70gihFp2hmCIa0n1yZnSh2USysoRrkLRNYMllZoR6fLm78oRGanlQkM87iLmWFnRW2Mm7ZUlVFLmMVUm7Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUsg47aMmUsgtA8pUKcc&oid=1855776123&tid=1047&nid=10647&e=.jpg\"></p></div></div>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://hkyh.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=jMm7w8L4UaLR6RnX7-YnR7snRLaLl7/4nR6Vnl7ZMzM2MmG0gihFp2hmCIa0USyDMShVMYysUm67U4lbL4-snlLDUlUiL8CZUm67M77ioz6FM4CsnmNin7QFLmrfMR9Jqjfjo4OeoDAK_dN0qIbtpYyPLRUsg47aMmUsgtA8pUKcc&oid=1855776123&ti